  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Register and Land Title Stage II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Titulacin y Registro Tierras Etapa II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT GOAL IS TO SUPPORT THE ESTABLISHEMENT OF A LAND MARKET IN RURAL PERU. IT WILL CONTINUE WITH LAND REGULARIZATION, RURAL CADASTRAL ACTIVITIES AND MODERNIZATION OF REGISTRY INSTITUTIONS. THE PROYECT GOAL IS THE LEGAL AND PHYSICAL REGULARIZATION OF 1,100,000 ADDITIONAL PARCELS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
